      "text": "<math> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> <mtext>&nbsp;:&nbsp;</mtext> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>&nbsp;:&nbsp;</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </math>",
