  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let P<sub>A</sub>, P<sub>B</sub>, P<sub>C</sub> be the initial pressures of the three samples and P be the final pressure of each.<br /><br />For A process is adiabatic, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math>constant<br /><br /><mo></mo><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>V</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>V</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi></math><br /><br />For B, the process is isobaric&nbsp; <mo></mo><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi></math><br /><br />For C, the process is isothermal, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo></math> constant<br /><br /><mo></mo><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>V</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi></math><br /><br />Hence, <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>P</mtext> <mtext>A</mtext> </msub> <mtext>&#160;:&#160;</mtext> <msub> <mtext>P</mtext> <mtext>B</mtext> </msub> <mtext>&#160;:&#160;</mtext> <msub> <mtext>P</mtext> <mtext>C</mtext> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <msup> <mn>2</mn> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <mo>/</mo> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </msup> <mtext>&#160;:&#160;</mtext> <mn>1</mn> <mtext>&#160;:&#160;</mtext> <mn>2</mn> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> <mtext>&#160;:&#160;</mtext> <mn>1</mn> <mtext>&#160;:&#160;</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </math>",
